e month. It also brings total stock close to the 232-unit limit, and anything over the limit is lost on arrival. Candidates 4 and 5 hit that limit most clearly.\n3. **Daily ordering (candidate 7) loses on fees.** It places about 15 more orders than the every-other-day plans, which costs roughly 650 extra.\n4. **Within the every-other-day group:**\n   - Product 0 orders are about 62 against an expected two-day demand of about 50. That puts candidate 3 roughly one standard deviation above demand, against about 0.3 for candidate 0. Given the cost imbalance in point 1, extra cover is worth it.\n   - Candidates 0 and 3 order the most product 1, about 1.25 times the forecast.\n   - Candidate 3's peak stock stays around 200, under the 232 limit."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4350, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2305, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4350}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T21:44:38.004Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVNAqja7a3XYQy9aZANq"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_017mCQNpLE8mAQg2AXWeSxT4", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVNArDLdD4qZQm4FTJKo", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_017mCQNpLE8mAQg2AXWeSxT4", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.25, 0.04, 0.1, 0.42, 0.02, 0.04, 0.1, 0.03]}, "caller": {"ty